  I seemed to have stumbled accross AN MAJOR FLAW in the pick-up command
  In my most recent game of NETHACK 3.0 pl5, I was meandering around the dungeon  with by far the nastiest charecter I had yet to run, thashing EVERYTHING in
  sight, in other words, the Invincible Dr.Megadice

  Anywho, I ran accross a Cockatrice, and deciding it better to shoot it with
  a bow than duke it out hand to hand, I did so, killing it with but a few
  simple shots, so I strolled back to where it was, to get back into the
  main room(the corpse was blocking my only passage back).

  I know what happens when you touch a cockatrice corpse, you turn to stone
  plain and simple, that is why I turned my auto pick-up OFF!
  Howeveer this did me absolutely no good when I walked accross the corpse
  as you can guess, I turned to stone, and my mondo game was lost.

  Now, if this is supposed to happen(turn to stone when you touch the corpse
  with your pickup off)Then it should be changed, The Nethack gods
  seem to strive for some semblence of reality/fairness, and I can 
  see no justification for the afore mentioed occurence to occur.

  If it isn't supposed to be that way, then please please please
  fix it.  We nethackers would be most thankful

